WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
This is the first scene of the Stage E
verification matrix.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.200
The second scene carries an imported
image.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.800
The third scene shows a chart drawn from
real data.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.700
And the fourth closes on a single number.
